# Lab 07 - Azure Storage / Private Endpoint / Managed Identity

I completed Lab 07 by creating an Azure Storage Account and connecting to its Blob Storage and Azure Files services through Private Endpoints.

This lab focused on **Azure Storage, private networking, Private DNS, Managed Identity, RBAC, storage access tiers, and Lifecycle Management**.

---

