# 10. RBAC

I retrieved the Storage Account Resource ID:

```bash
STORAGE_ID=$(az storage account show \
  --resource-group $RG \
  --name $STORAGE \
  --query id \
  --output tsv)
```

I then assigned the VM's Managed Identity the role:

```text
Storage Blob Data Contributor
```

using:

```bash
az role assignment create \
  --assignee-object-id "$PRINCIPAL_ID" \
  --assignee-principal-type ServicePrincipal \
  --role "Storage Blob Data Contributor" \
  --scope "$STORAGE_ID"
```

The important concept was:

```text
Managed Identity
      ↓
Who?
      ↓
Principal ID

RBAC Role
      ↓
What can it do?
      ↓
Storage Blob Data Contributor

Scope
      ↓
Where?
      ↓
Storage Account
```

Therefore:

```text
VM Identity
    ↓
Storage Blob Data Contributor
    ↓
Storage Account
    ↓
Blob Storage
```

