# Important Concepts Learned

### Storage Account

A Storage Account provides Azure storage services such as:

```text
Blob Storage
Azure Files
```

---

### Blob Storage

Object storage used for data such as logs and backups.

---

### Azure Files

Managed file storage that can provide shared file-system access.

---

### Private Endpoint

Provides a private IP address inside a VNet for accessing Azure services privately.

---

### Private DNS

Allows Azure service hostnames to resolve to Private Endpoint IP addresses.

---

### Managed Identity

Provides an Azure-managed identity for applications and VMs.

---

### RBAC

Controls what an identity is authorized to do.

---

### Access Token

A short-lived credential used to prove the identity when accessing an Azure service.

---

### Lifecycle Management

Automatically performs actions on Blob data based on conditions such as age.

---

### Management Plane

Used to manage Azure resources.

---

### Data Plane

Used to access the actual data stored in an Azure service.

